BDFTOPCF
========

A git submodule (see docs/contrib.md), not a copy of the sources:

url    = https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/util/bdftopcf.git
tag    = bdftopcf-1.1.2
commit = 0ee2c68b5d3ea3eb36f895d9dfcc4ebe1416f176
date   = 2024-10-12

tools/desktop/build-fonts.sh compiles bdftopcf with the base compiler
(the object list of its Makefile.am; config.h written in the work
directory, with the defines it needs) and converts the misc BDF fonts
with `bdftopcf -t`. Not built: bdftopcf's compression support (bzip2), the
man pages. It needs the X protocol headers of contrib/xorgproto. Nothing
is written into the submodule.

